# flutter/assets holds source artwork, not build output; keep its PNGs versioned.
!flutter/assets/*png
# brand/tray-dark-mode holds source artwork too, not build output: the tray
# silhouettes regenerated by `analysis/brand/gen-tray-dark-mode.py`. Two of its
# ICOs are embedded with `include_bytes!`. `*png` above also matches the `png`
# directory name, so the directory has to be re-included before its files can be.
!brand/tray-dark-mode/png/
!brand/tray-dark-mode/png/*png
